# OPEN HOUSE: the five set lists each sell a fixed set of guests and stars
# that never changes, whatever the deal; only the Random list (and the
# owner's OPEN ALL NIGHT big mix) picks guests at random. Each list is
# started from the tile grid with the buttons, and list 1 twice.
game openhouse
wait 30
cheat won 31
press A
wait 5
press A
wait 5
expect state == 2
expect scen_sel == 5
press UP
press LEFT
press LEFT
